&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Zscaler (NASDAQ: ZS) accelerates digital transformation so customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. The Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange™️ platform protects thousands of customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location. Distributed across 160+ public exchanges globally and thousands of private exchanges at the edge, the SASE-based Zero Trust Exchange is the world’s largest in-line cloud security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of work is Human + AI and are building an AI-native enterprise where human potential is amplified by machine intelligence to solve the world’s hardest security challenges. Driven by deep customer obsession, we are committed to the mission, outcome, and to each other. We bring these commitments to life through three core behaviors: ownership and collaboration, trust through outcomes and impact, and a challenge culture with ongoing feedback. Ready to make an impact at the company pioneering security transformation in the AI era? Join us at Zscaler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an Associate Solutions Consultant II to join our team. This is a remote (based in either&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Spain, Belgium, Poland or UK&amp;amp;I)&lt;/span&gt; role, reporting directly to the Global Velocity Director of Partner Engineering within our Virtual Solution Center division. In this role, you will be a vital member of the Solution Center team, driving initial technical pre-sales engagements for our internal groups and external partners. Your core focus will center on mastering our ecosystem, executing foundational technical strategies, and progressively cultivating the expertise necessary to directly sway partner-driven business opportunities. Working in tandem with experienced engineers, you will assist with platform demonstrations, initial discovery sessions, and partner enablement initiatives, all while building the deep business insights and technical capabilities required to advance into a standalone Sales Engineer position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver responsive technical assistance to distributors, partners, and internal business units by conducting&amp;nbsp;introductory discovery, product positioning, and architecture walkthroughs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support live product demonstrations and dedicated Solution Demo Center environments, collaborating closely with&amp;nbsp;senior Sales Engineers during active co-selling cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up, manage, and troubleshoot active sandbox or lab environments while creating reusable technical assets and&amp;nbsp;instructional documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the execution of partner enablement programs by facilitating formal onboarding tracks, technical training&amp;nbsp;events, and interactive workshops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with international colleagues across the global Solution Center to provide seamless cross-regional support&amp;nbsp;and map technical architectures to client requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You operate as a high-integrity team player who prioritizes collective success over individual accolades, actively&amp;nbsp;sharing and absorbing candid, respectful feedback to cultivate organizational trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You maintain an unwavering focus on the customer, developing genuine empathy for external clients and internal&amp;nbsp;stakeholders to ensure every technical solution addresses genuine business challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You drive initiatives forward with an intense bias for action, maintaining an unwavering commitment to execution&amp;nbsp;speed and output quality within fast-moving landscapes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You advocate for clarity by breaking down dense architectural concepts and multifaceted user requirements into&amp;nbsp;streamlined, actionable frameworks as an articulate communicator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess a dedicated growth mindset and an appetite for continuous self-improvement, routinely seeking out mentorship and feedback to elevate your technical capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven&amp;nbsp;solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to two years of professional exposure within a technical capacity, including engineering internships, customer&amp;nbsp;support, systems administration, or introductory infrastructure assignments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Essential grasp of core internetworking principles and protocols, specifically encompassing TCP/IP suites, DNS configurations, HTTP mechanisms, and secure tunneling technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possession of an undergraduate degree or a demonstrated equivalent track record of practical hands-on&amp;nbsp;experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability and willingness to undertake occasional regional travel up to roughly ten percent of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;French language proficiency is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical familiarity with modern generative AI environments or utilizing automated workflows to streamline lab deployments and technical problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Early academic or professional exposure to edge security frameworks, including Secure Web Gateways, Zero Trust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network Access, Data Loss Prevention, or Cloud Access Security Brokers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on background orchestrating live application proof-of-concepts or sandbox instances, complemented by&amp;nbsp;active technology certifications or structured coursework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-LJ1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zscaler.com/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. We strive to create a workplace where employees are treated with respect and have the chance to succeed. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy or related medical conditions), age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. &lt;em&gt;See more information by clicking on the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights: Workplace Discrimination is Illegal &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;link.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
